sive summary:\n\n## Git Server Setup Summary\n\nYour Git server is successfully configured with all required features:\n\n### ✅ Git Repository Server\n- **Location**: `ssh://git@localhost:/git/project.git`\n- **Authentication**: Password-based SSH\n  - Username: `git`\n  - Password: `password`\n- **Service**: OpenSSH server with password authentication enabled\n\n### ✅ HTTPS Deployment Endpoints\n- **Main branch**: `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n  - Serves content from `/var/www/html/`\n- **Dev branch**: `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n  - Serves content from `/var/www/dev/`\n- **SSL**: Self-signed certificate at `/etc/nginx/ssl/`\n\n### ✅ Automatic Deployments\n- **Post-receive hook** at `/git/project.git/hooks/post-receive`\n- Triggers automatically on every push\n- Deploys relevant branch to corresponding directory\n- Deployment speed: **< 1 second** (well within 3-second requirement)\n\n### ✅ Services Running\n- SSH server: `sshd` (port 22)\n- Nginx: Listening on HTTPS port 8443\n- Git server: Bare repository at `/git/project.git`\n\n### Testing the System\n\nYou can test the complete workflow:\n\n```bash\n# Clone the repository\nSSHPASS=password sshpass -e git clone ssh://git@localhost:/git/project.git my-repo\n\n# Set up git\ncd my-repo\ngit config user.name \"Your Name\"\ngit config user.email \"your@email.com\"\n\n# Create and push main branch\necho \"main branch content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html\ngit commit -m \"Add main\"\ngit branch -M main\nGIT_SSH_COMMAND=\"sshpass -p password ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no\" git push -u origin main\n\n# Create and push dev branch\ngit checkout -b dev\necho \"dev branch content\" > index.html\ngit add index.html\ngit commit -m \"Add dev\"\nGIT_SSH_COMMAND=\"sshpass -p password ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no\" git push -u origin dev\n\n# Verify deployments\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html              # main branch content\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html          # dev branch content\n```\n\nThe server is ready for use and will automatically deploy changes from both branches when they're pushed!","ttft_ms":2952,"type":"result","duration_ms":228953,"uuid":"dfb040c7-2936-417f-b30f-a15fe123216c","ttft_stream_ms":942,"time_to_request_ms":47,"queued_turn_count":0}
